# 基础词 Unit04
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2025红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit04核心词汇

{{awkward}}{{/ˈɔːkwəd}}{{adj. 尴尬的；笨拙的}}{{There was an awkward silence after his comment.}}
{{background}}{{/ˈbækɡraʊnd}}{{n. 背景；经历}}{{She has a strong background in computer science.}}
{{backward}}{{/ˈbækwəd}}{{adj./adv. 向后的；落后地}}{{The country is still backward in terms of technology.}}
{{bacteria}}{{/bækˈtɪəriə}}{{n. 细菌}}{{Bacteria can cause various diseases in humans.}}
{{balance}}{{/ˈbæləns}}{{n./v. 平衡；权衡}}{{It is important to maintain a balance between work and life.}}
{{ban}}{{/bæn}}{{v./n. 禁止；禁令}}{{The government imposed a ban on smoking in public places.}}
{{band}}{{/bænd}}{{n. 乐队；带；一群}}{{The rock band performed at the music festival.}}
{{bank}}{{/bæŋk}}{{n. 银行；河岸}}{{She deposited the money in the bank.}}
{{bar}}{{/bɑːr}}{{n. 酒吧；条；障碍}}{{They met at a bar after work.}}
{{bare}}{{/beər}}{{adj. 赤裸的；空的}}{{The room was bare except for a table and chair.}}
{{bargain}}{{/ˈbɑːɡɪn}}{{n./v. 便宜货；讨价还价}}{{She found a real bargain at the flea market.}}
{{barrier}}{{/ˈbæriər}}{{n. 障碍；屏障}}{{Language can be a barrier to communication.}}
{{base}}{{/beɪs}}{{n./v. 基础；以…为基础}}{{The theory is based on years of research.}}
{{basic}}{{/ˈbeɪsɪk}}{{adj. 基本的；基础的}}{{Everyone should have access to basic healthcare.}}
{{basis}}{{/ˈbeɪsɪs}}{{n. 基础；根据}}{{On what basis did you make this decision?}}
{{battle}}{{/ˈbætl}}{{n./v. 战斗；斗争}}{{The battle lasted for several days.}}
{{bear}}{{/beər}}{{v./n. 承受；忍受；熊}}{{I cannot bear the noise any longer.}}
{{beat}}{{/biːt}}{{v./n. 打；击败；节拍}}{{Our team beat the champions in the final match.}}
{{behalf}}{{/bɪˈhɑːf}}{{n. 代表；利益}}{{I am writing on behalf of the entire team.}}
{{behave}}{{/bɪˈheɪv}}{{v. 表现；行为}}{{The children behaved well during the ceremony.}}
{{being}}{{/ˈbiːɪŋ}}{{n. 存在；生物}}{{Human beings have always been curious about the universe.}}
{{belief}}{{/bɪˈliːf}}{{n. 信念；信仰}}{{She has a strong belief in the power of education.}}
{{belong}}{{/bɪˈlɒŋ}}{{v. 属于；适合}}{{This book belongs to the school library.}}
{{beloved}}{{/bɪˈlʌvɪd}}{{adj./n. 深爱的；爱人}}{{He dedicated the book to his beloved wife.}}
{{bench}}{{/bentʃ}}{{n. 长凳；工作台}}{{They sat on a bench in the park and watched the sunset.}}
{{bend}}{{/bend}}{{v./n. 弯曲；弯道}}{{The road bends sharply to the left.}}
{{benefit}}{{/ˈbenɪfɪt}}{{n./v. 好处；受益}}{{Regular exercise has many health benefits.}}
{{beside}}{{/bɪˈsaɪd}}{{prep. 在…旁边}}{{She sat beside me during the concert.}}
{{besides}}{{/bɪˈsaɪdz}}{{prep./adv. 除…之外；而且}}{{Besides English, she also speaks Japanese.}}
{{betray}}{{/bɪˈtreɪ}}{{v. 背叛；泄露}}{{He felt betrayed by his closest friend.}}
{{better}}{{/ˈbetər}}{{adj./adv. 更好的；更好地}}{{Practice makes you better at any skill.}}
{{beyond}}{{/bɪˈjɒnd}}{{prep./adv. 超越；在…之外}}{{The view from the mountain was beyond description.}}
{{billion}}{{/ˈbɪljən}}{{n. 十亿}}{{The company is worth several billion dollars.}}
{{bind}}{{/baɪnd}}{{v. 捆绑；约束}}{{The contract binds both parties to the agreement.}}
{{biology}}{{/baɪˈɒlədʒi}}{{n. 生物学}}{{She is majoring in biology at university.}}
{{birth}}{{/bɜːθ}}{{n. 出生；起源}}{{The birth of the internet changed the world.}}
{{bite}}{{/baɪt}}{{v./n. 咬；叮}}{{Be careful, the dog might bite.}}
{{bitter}}{{/ˈbɪtər}}{{adj. 苦的；痛苦的}}{{The medicine has a bitter taste.}}
{{blame}}{{/bleɪm}}{{v./n. 责备；归咎于}}{{Don't blame others for your own mistakes.}}
{{blank}}{{/blæŋk}}{{adj./n. 空白的；空白}}{{Please fill in the blank spaces on the form.}}
{{blanket}}{{/ˈblæŋkɪt}}{{n. 毯子；覆盖物}}{{She wrapped herself in a warm blanket.}}
{{blast}}{{/blɑːst}}{{n./v. 爆炸；一阵}}{{The blast destroyed several buildings nearby.}}
{{bleed}}{{/bliːd}}{{v. 流血；出血}}{{His finger was bleeding from the cut.}}
{{blend}}{{/blend}}{{v./n. 混合；融合}}{{The coffee blend has a unique flavor.}}
{{bless}}{{/bles}}{{v. 保佑；祝福}}{{May God bless you and your family.}}
{{blind}}{{/blaɪnd}}{{adj./v. 盲的；使失明}}{{He has been blind since birth.}}
{{block}}{{/blɒk}}{{n./v. 街区；阻塞}}{{The fallen tree blocked the road.}}
{{blood}}{{/blʌd}}{{n. 血；血统}}{{Blood tests can detect various health conditions.}}
{{bloom}}{{/bluːm}}{{v./n. 开花；繁盛}}{{The flowers bloom beautifully in spring.}}
{{blow}}{{/bləʊ}}{{v./n. 吹；打击}}{{The wind blew the leaves off the trees.}}
{{board}}{{/bɔːd}}{{n./v. 板；董事会；登上}}{{Passengers began to board the plane.}}
{{boast}}{{/bəʊst}}{{v./n. 自夸；夸耀}}{{He boasted about his achievements to everyone.}}
{{bold}}{{/bəʊld}}{{adj. 大胆的；醒目的}}{{She made a bold decision to start her own business.}}
{{bomb}}{{/bɒm}}{{n./v. 炸弹；轰炸}}{{The bomb exploded near the embassy.}}
{{bond}}{{/bɒnd}}{{n./v. 纽带；联系；结合}}{{The mother and child share a strong emotional bond.}}
{{boom}}{{/buːm}}{{n./v. 繁荣；隆隆声}}{{The tech industry experienced a boom in the 2000s.}}
{{boost}}{{/buːst}}{{v./n. 促进；增加}}{{The new policy will boost the economy.}}
{{border}}{{/ˈbɔːdər}}{{n./v. 边界；接壤}}{{The river forms the border between the two countries.}}
{{bore}}{{/bɔːr}}{{v./n. 使厌烦；钻孔}}{{The long lecture bored the students.}}
{{born}}{{/bɔːn}}{{adj. 出生的；天生的}}{{She was born in a small town in southern China.}}
{{bother}}{{/ˈbɒðər}}{{v. 打扰；烦恼}}{{Don't bother me while I'm studying.}}
{{bounce}}{{/baʊns}}{{v./n. 弹跳；反弹}}{{The ball bounced off the wall.}}
{{bound}}{{/baʊnd}}{{adj./v. 一定的；跳跃}}{{She is bound to succeed with her talent and hard work.}}
{{boundary}}{{/ˈbaʊndri}}{{n. 边界；界限}}{{The river marks the boundary of the national park.}}
{{branch}}{{/brɑːntʃ}}{{n./v. 分支；分行}}{{The bank has branches all over the country.}}
{{brand}}{{/brænd}}{{n./v. 品牌；打烙印}}{{This brand is known for its high-quality products.}}
{{brave}}{{/breɪv}}{{adj. 勇敢的}}{{The brave firefighter saved the child from the burning building.}}
{{break}}{{/breɪk}}{{v./n. 打破；休息；突破}}{{Let's take a break after two hours of study.}}
{{breath}}{{/breθ}}{{n. 呼吸；气息}}{{She took a deep breath before giving the speech.}}
{{breed}}{{/briːd}}{{v./n. 繁殖；品种}}{{This farm breeds high-quality cattle.}}
{{breeze}}{{/briːz}}{{n. 微风；轻松的事}}{{A gentle breeze blew through the open window.}}
{{bridge}}{{/brɪdʒ}}{{n./v. 桥；弥补}}{{The new bridge connects the two towns.}}
{{brief}}{{/briːf}}{{adj./n. 简短的；摘要}}{{He gave a brief summary of the report.}}
{{brilliant}}{{/ˈbrɪliənt}}{{adj. 杰出的；明亮的}}{{She is a brilliant scientist with many achievements.}}
{{bring}}{{/brɪŋ}}{{v. 带来；引起}}{{Please bring your textbook to class tomorrow.}}
{{broad}}{{/brɔːd}}{{adj. 宽阔的；广泛的}}{{The road is broad enough for four lanes.}}
{{broadcast}}{{/ˈbrɔːdkɑːst}}{{v./n. 广播；播出}}{{The event was broadcast live on national television.}}
{{brochure}}{{/ˈbrəʊʃər}}{{n. 小册子；宣传册}}{{Pick up a brochure for more information about the tour.}}
{{budget}}{{/ˈbʌdʒɪt}}{{n./v. 预算；编预算}}{{The government increased the education budget this year.}}
{{bullet}}{{/ˈbʊlɪt}}{{n. 子弹}}{{The bullet missed the target by a few inches.}}
{{bunch}}{{/bʌntʃ}}{{n. 一束；一群}}{{He bought a bunch of flowers for his mother.}}
{{burden}}{{/ˈbɜːdn}}{{n./v. 负担；使负重}}{{The financial burden was too heavy for the family.}}
{{burst}}{{/bɜːst}}{{v./n. 爆裂；突然发生}}{{The balloon burst when he sat on it.}}
{{bury}}{{/ˈberi}}{{v. 埋葬；掩埋}}{{The dog buried its bone in the garden.}}
{{button}}{{/ˈbʌtn}}{{n. 按钮；纽扣}}{{Press the green button to start the machine.}}
